    "body": "More sightings from the Windows quick checks of main, 2026-11-22:\n\n- bacon, main `054c1e24bb15` (quick since `148a5c832aa8`): `ui suites: lib` and `ui suites: egui_app` exit `0xC0000005` (access violation); one more ui binary exits `0xC0000374` (heap corruption) after 1 s.\n- Lenny, main `ef1572114381` (quick since `835556814a9d`): `ui suites: trace_parity` exits `0xC0000005` after 5 s, twice.\n\nSo the crash now also hits `trace_parity`, and one run ended in heap corruption instead of an access violation. The Linux and macOS quick checks of the same heads are green.\n",
